# A program asking the lookup doors (D391, D393) and the player door (D390)
# for what is not there: places past either end and far past them, an
# entity this run made, one without the component, and the null entity.
program peek.kest

component 3d6c1e2a-8f47-4b09-a5d1-7c2e9f0b4a63 peek.probe Probe
component 9a41f7c5-2e6d-4b38-91fa-0c5d8e3b7a12 peek.mark Mark

system peek.peek simulation peek write peek.probe lookup peek.mark entities

spawn 1 peek.probe
spawn 3 peek.mark at=7
